# Keys whose signature deploy/deploy.sh accepts on the commit it is about to deploy.
# One line per key, in git's SSH allowed-signers format:
#
#   <email>  namespaces="git"  <key-type> <base64-public-key>
#
# e.g.  you@example.com namespaces="git" ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3Nza...
#
# While this file lists no keys, deploys still run but signatures are NOT checked.
# Setup and the GitHub merge-button caveat: docs/DEPLOY.md section 9.
